('Potluck', 'The Comedy Store''s legendary walk-up mic. Every Sunday and Monday. Sign ups will happen between 4pm and 5:30. The list of selected performers will up in the Original Room window at 6pm. Doors open at 6:30 and the show starts at 7pm.', 'The Comedy Store', '8433 W Sunset Blvd, West Hollywood, CA', '2026-03-23', '16:00:00', '21:00:00', 'published', true, '[]'::jsonb, 'West Hollywood', 34.0904, -118.3862, 'https://www.instagram.com/thecomedystore/', 'https://thecomedystore.com/'),
('Women''s Mic (Trans and NB Inclusive) @ Tao Comedy Studio', 'Intersectional feminist comedy space in Koreatown running 5+ mics per week. $5/5 min or $10/10 min. Sign-ups open 30 min before showtime. No pro-violence material policy. One of LA''s most welcoming mic environments. Comes with a punch card to get free mics.', 'Tao Comedy Studio', '131 S Western Ave, Los Angeles, CA', '2026-03-23', '20:00:00', '21:30:00', 'published', true, '[]'::jsonb, 'Los Angeles', 34.0625, -118.3084, 'https://www.instagram.com/taocomedystudio/', 'https://taocomedystudio.com/tao-comedy-studio/open-mics/'),
('LGBTQ and Allies Secret Mic', 'Burbank''s go-to comedy club running multiple open mics daily. Lottery format, 3-5 minute sets. Show up early to enter the lottery.', 'Flappers Comedy Club', '102 E Magnolia Blvd, Burbank, CA', '2026-03-23', '18:30:00', '20:30:00', 'published', true, '[]'::jsonb, 'Burbank', 34.1808, -118.3075, 'https://www.instagram.com/flapperscomedy/', 'https://www.flapperscomedy.com/site/calendar_test_2025.php'),
