('Open Mic Comedy Night', 'Monday night open mic comedy at Lyric Hyperion in Silver Lake. Doors open at 8:45 PM; show starts at 9:00 PM. $4 for performers / free to watch. 15 performers selected via bucket lottery - arrive by 8:45 PM to add your name. Sets are 4 minutes. Sign up via Eventbrite.', 'Lyric Hyperion', '2106 Hyperion Ave, Los Angeles, CA', '2026-03-23', '21:00:00', '23:00:00', 'published', true, '[]'::jsonb, 'Los Angeles', 34.1048, -118.2726, 'https://www.instagram.com/lyrichyperion/', 'https://www.eventbrite.com/e/open-mic-comedy-night-at-lyric-hyperion-tickets-1975247290819'),
('The Good Mic', 'Thursday morning open mic at Lyric Hyperion in Silver Lake. 5 minute sets. Lottery 20 spots. Doors open before 10:00 AM; show starts at 10:00 AM. Sign up via Eventbrite. 1 item minimum from cafe. Public welcome!', 'Lyric Hyperion', '2106 Hyperion Ave, Los Angeles, CA', '2026-03-26', '10:00:00', '12:00:00', 'published', true, '[]'::jsonb, 'Los Angeles', 34.1048, -118.2726, 'https://www.instagram.com/lyrichyperion/', 'https://www.eventbrite.com/e/the-good-mic-tickets-591580381847'),
('Breaking The Ice', 'Every-other-Thursday open mic. Doors open at 5:30 PM; show starts at 6:00 PM. One menu item = one bucket pull. No limit on entries. Open to the public to watch. Tickets available on Showclix.', 'The Ice House', '24 N Mentor Ave, Pasadena, CA', '2026-03-26', '18:00:00', '20:00:00', 'published', true, '[]'::jsonb, 'Pasadena', 34.148, -118.1499, 'https://www.instagram.com/theicehousecc/', 'https://www.showclix.com/event/breaking-the-ice-open-mic-03-26-26-6-pm'),
